L72: \nL73: Track Activities\nL74: \nL75: Keep a detailed timeline of your job search, from the day you apply until the day you receive an offer, helping you monitor every step and stay on top of your activities.\nL76: \nL77: Contact Tracker\nL78: Manage and track all your networking contacts, including recruiters and senior leaders, to maintain a strong professional network and ensure you never lose touch with key connections.\nL79: \nL80: Upload and Manage Documents\nL81: \nL82: Easily store, organize, and access all your resumes, cover letters, and other essential documents in one place, ensuring you have the right materials for every application.\nL83: \nL84: Map View\nL85: Visualize the locations of potential employers on a map, allowing you to choose jobs that are conveniently close to home and avoid long commutes, making your job search more efficient.\nL86: \nL87: Metrics\nL88: \nL89: Gain insights into your job search with detailed metrics, helping you track your progress, identify areas for improvement, and refine your strategy to land your next role faster.\nL90: Huntr’s job application tracker helps you stay organized during a busy job search. Use one-click automation to securely store all application details faster in a sleek, user-friendly interface.\nL91: ## Effortless Job Tracking\nL92: \nL93: Track all your job applications, interviews, documents, and more in one convenient place. Remember every opportunity, regardless of where you found it.\nL94: \nL95: cite28†Track Your Search L96: \nL97: cite31†Image: Effortless Job Tracking†imagedelivery.net L98: ## Save Job Details Faster\nL99: \nL100: Store all application information in one click with the Chrome Job Clipper. Show up to every interview prepared without having to worry about job listings being taken down or awkward questions about salary expectations.\nL101: \nL102: cite28†Start Saving Jobs L103: \nL104: cite32†Image: Save Job Details Faster†imagedelivery.net L105: ## Monitor Interview Milestones\nL106: \nL107: Easily drag and drop job applications into the interview stage on Huntr’s intuitive Kanban board. Log your interview date and time so you never miss another interview again.\nL108: \nL109: cite28†Start Logging Interviews L110: \nL111: cite33†Image: Monitor Interview Milestones†imagedelivery.net L112: ## Manage Multiple Resumes\nL113: \nL114: Tailoring your resume for each application? Great! Seamlessly store a unique resume and cover letter per job to easily access the correct documents during interviews.\nL115: \nL116: cite28†Manage Your Resumes L117: \nL118: cite34†Image: Manage Multiple Resumes†imagedelivery.net L119: ## Retain New Connections\nL120: \nL121: Meeting countless recruiters and senior leaders during the interview process? Manage your networking efforts with contact tracking.\nL122: \nL123: cite28†Manage Your Contacts L124: \nL125: cite35†Image: Retain New Connections†imagedelivery.net L126: \nL127: ## Choose Jobs Close to Home\nL128: \nL129: Tired of long commutes? Huntr’s Map View allows you to see how close to home the companies you’re interviewing at are.\nL130: \nL131: cite28†Start Visualizing Your Search L132: \nL133: cite36†Image: Choose Jobs Close to Home†imagedelivery.net L134: ## Improve Your Job Search\nL135: \nL136: Getting data on how your job search is going can help you land your next role faster. Gain access to job metrics to track your progress and identify areas of improvement.\nL137: \nL138: cite28†Get Job Metrics L139: \nL140: cite37†Image: Improve Your Job Search†imagedelivery.net L141: ## Track Activity Details\nL142: \nL143: Trying to figure out timelines of when you applied or did your last interview? View a complete timeline from the day you apply until the day you get an offer.\nL144: \nL145: cite28†Start Tracking Activities L146: \nL147: cite38†Image: Track Activity Details†imagedelivery.net L148: \nL149: Join 500,000+ job seekers who’ve used Huntr to track their applications, manage their job search, and land jobs at 1000s of companies\nL150: cite39†Image: goldman-sacks-logo cite40†Image: spotify-logo cite41†Image: chase-logo cite42†Image: twitter-logo cite43†Image: dropbox-logo cite44†Image: google-logo cite45†Image: microsoft-logo cite46†Image: ibm-logo cite47†Image: uber-logo cite48†Image: salesforce-logo cite49†Image: apple-logo L151: ## Track Your Job Search Faster\nL152: \nL153: Spend less time organizing your job search by using easy one-click functions and drag-and-drop features on Huntr to streamline your job tracking. With all the time you save in tracking details, you’ll have more time to prepare for interviews, so you can land an amazing new job.\nL154: \nL155: cite28†Sign Up for Free L156: \nL157: ## Frequently Asked Questions\nL158: ### What is a job tracker?\nL159: \nL160: A job tracker is a tool you can use to help monitor all your job search details in one place, to easily assess how your job search is going and how you can improve.\nL161: \nL162: ### How can I track my job search?\nL163: \nL164: You can track your job search by signing up for Huntr’s job tracking tool, where you’ll be able to import job details, store contacts and documents, view company location maps, track activity details, and more for free.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCareerflow - Your Career Copilot | Powerful AI Job Search Tools (https://www.careerflow.ai/)\nciteturn15view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn13view1\",\"lineno\":503}); Total lines: 1207\nL427: ## Explore our full suite of AI tools & features\nL428: \nL429: Enhance your job-hunting experience with tools for every step\nL430: \nL431: cite38†LinkedIn Profile Optimizer cite38†Chrome Extension cite38†Interview Preparation L432: \nL433: cite38†AI Cover Letter Generator cite38†Networking Tracker L434: \nL435: c